From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:00:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove link to missing EXAMPLES.md from README

The README pointed to an EXAMPLES.md that doesn't exist in the repo.
The examples for each kind of test are already in the README's Usage
section, so drop the dangling link.

Fixes #11
---
 README.md      | 2 --
 README.repo.md | 2 --
 2 files changed, 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index abfe6bd..2f88215 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -29,8 +29,6 @@ $ bundle exec hanami setup
 
 ## Usage
 
-For detailed examples, see [EXAMPLES.md](EXAMPLES.md).
-
 When you run `hanami setup`, this gem will automatically:
 
 - Add test dependencies to your `Gemfile`
diff --git a/README.repo.md b/README.repo.md
index cb1b063..8be81c0 100644
--- a/README.repo.md
+++ b/README.repo.md
@@ -17,8 +17,6 @@ $ bundle exec hanami setup
 
 ## Usage
 
-For detailed examples, see [EXAMPLES.md](EXAMPLES.md).
-
 When you run `hanami setup`, this gem will automatically:
 
 - Add test dependencies to your `Gemfile`
